{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186160/extras/4544551e204fe4162c13b3980390bdc1.avif?t=1706295304\" width=626 height=308 /></span><br><br>A challenging game focused on overcoming hard goals by learning the levels and creating your own strategies. You must find how to be flawless by practice, no rpg elements, upgrades or procedural content, its <strong>ALL ON YOU</strong> from start to finish, no luck or stats involved.<br><br>As a <strong>SCORE ATTACK SHOOTER</strong> you will have to chain together kills quickly to stack up your combo meter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186160/extras/4e1ff577258f0b122854e35b6e91acc4.poster.avif?t=1706295304\" width=480 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186160/extras/4e1ff577258f0b122854e35b6e91acc4.webm?t=1706295304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186160/extras/4e1ff577258f0b122854e35b6e91acc4.mp4?t=1706295304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Quick and short</strong> fast paced levels, so that you can drop in and drop out.<br><strong>Memorization, learning and repetition</strong> are a big part of it, you will feel that progress will come from your own knowledge of the game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186160/extras/674ee0313d43d948c375c0c36cd80b61.avif?t=1706295304\" width=626 height=99 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>5 Difficulty</strong> settings<br></li><li><strong>Multiple weapons</strong> with <strong>special abilities</strong> tied to each of them<br></li><li><strong>Varied enemy types</strong> so that you have to learn multiple ways of dealing with them<br></li><li><strong>3 Chapters </strong>with an evolving visual style (<strong>30+ Levels</strong>)<br></li><li><strong>Score Based Objectives</strong> and <strong>Level Specific Objectives</strong> like escaping a prison or destroying a monument<br></li><li>No procedural content, you are not going to win based on luck<br></li><li>No story, jump straight to <strong>GAMEPLAY</strong><br></li><li>Soundtrack with <strong>50 plus songs</strong><br></li><li><strong>CHEAT CODES</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186160/extras/27070d70594c7fba61b0e091bb722316.avif?t=1706295304\" width=626 height=78 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A lot of Quality of Life improvements, plus new features and levels.<br></li><li>Eight new levels based on old ones that will make you play them in a totally different way.<br></li><li>New objectives to complete, like earning points while freefalling from the sky, cleaning up a virus or completing a platforming puzzle.<br></li><li>Also new is a weapon that will be high-risk high reward, it gives a lot of damage but at the cost of being easy to miss and potentially losing the combo. You can use the weapon's ability for better results as it lets you remote control the projectile.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186160/extras/322ce74832d1aae39c2d61151c467c8f.poster.avif?t=1706295304\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186160/extras/322ce74832d1aae39c2d61151c467c8f.webm?t=1706295304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186160/extras/322ce74832d1aae39c2d61151c467c8f.mp4?t=1706295304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>With this update the Free Aim mode no longer is a cheat, so it can be accessed in the options menu and played without any of the penalties of using cheats.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186160/extras/0a3aab3faf61003139aa54d926393afb.poster.avif?t=1706295304\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186160/extras/0a3aab3faf61003139aa54d926393afb.webm?t=1706295304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186160/extras/0a3aab3faf61003139aa54d926393afb.mp4?t=1706295304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"73aabd78780af7c9b41efb8de344b71200595f4b.jpg","localized_name":"Basics Amateur","name":"Basics Amateur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1186160/73aabd78780af7c9b41efb8de344b71200595f4b.jpg"},{"icon":"a8e6e216386525163ca0a9fc24ded5fee800c2b4.jpg","localized_name":"Basics Adept","name":"Basics Adept","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1186160/a8e6e216386525163ca0a9fc24ded5fee800c2b4.jpg"},{"icon":"225fc929c9f36d3481792a0767bd9a466a42e750.jpg","localized_name":"Basics Ultimate","name":"Basics Ultimate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1186160/225fc929c9f36d3481792a0767bd9a466a42e750.jpg"},{"icon":"bebfcee14920ce4b3058f322acd23b80cc445528.jpg","localized_name":"Trial Amateur","name":"Trial Amateur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1186160/bebfcee14920ce4b3058f322acd23b80cc445528.jpg"},{"icon":"784bb9cc1afac080b02a0286d3c4c0422d97c054.jpg","localized_name":"Trial Adept","name":"Trial Adept","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/